# Reference papers stay local: publisher PDFs are copyrighted and docs/refs is
# ~136 MB, which would live in .git forever. Every note in docs/literature/
# cites its file name, so the path is still the citation; the file itself is a
# local copy, not something this repository redistributes.
docs/refs/*.pdf
docs/refs/*.xml

# Windows download-provenance streams that arrive next to copied files.
*:Zone.Identifier
